  "question": {
    "text": "The power radiated from a linear antenna of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> is proportional to<br />(Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo></math> Wavelength of wave):"
  },
